### 创建 Template
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "2-template",
  "description": "test",
  "type": "EXPERIMENT",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE",
  "yaml": "version:1"
}

### 获取 Template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新 Template
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "description": "Test Desc",
  "type": "EXPERIMENT",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "yaml": "version: 1.0"
}

### 删除 Template
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 搜索 Template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates?keyword=Test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Template 数量
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}